# anchor/tsa-ca.pem (REG-125): the roots and intermediates the anchor chain's RFC 3161 tokens
# verify against with -CAfile alone. DigiCert first (its 2025 CA1 intermediate, then DigiCert
# Trusted Root G4), GlobalSign second (Offline R45 Timestamping CA 2025, the R45 Timestamping
# Root cross-signed by R6, then GlobalSign Root CA - R6). Both roots come from the macOS keychain,
# chosen by the SHA-256 audit/tsa-measurement/verify.sh names, and the intermediates from the
# measured tokens. Written by make tsa-ca, never by hand. Verify with OpenSSL 3 (VERIFYING.md).
